{"seq":2,"slug":"warehousing-inventory","title":"仓储与库存管理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/logistics-mgmt/warehousing-inventory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"warehouse-planning-operations","title":"大学物流管理 — 仓储规划与作业","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/logistics-mgmt/warehousing-inventory/warehouse-planning-operations","wordCount":1557,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"inventory-control-models","title":"大学物流管理 — 库存控制模型","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/logistics-mgmt/warehousing-inventory/inventory-control-models","wordCount":1536,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"modern-warehouse-automation","title":"大学物流管理 — 现代仓储与自动化","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/logistics-mgmt/warehousing-inventory/modern-warehouse-automation","wordCount":1572,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"仓储与库存管理\">仓储与库存管理</h1><p>如果说运输是物流的&quot;血管&quot;，那么仓库和库存就是物流的&quot;蓄水池&quot;，用来缓冲供需在时间上的不匹配。本章讨论仓库该如何规划布局、作业流程如何组织，以及最核心的问题——到底该备多少库存。</p>\n<p>库存管理是物流中最考验&quot;算账能力&quot;的领域。备多了占用资金、增加仓储成本，备少了又会断货、丢失销售。本章将通过经济订货批量、安全库存、ABC 分类等经典工具，教你在&quot;多&quot;与&quot;少&quot;之间找到那个最优的平衡点。</p>\n"}